Ch.4 [theory] — EXPLAIN: Introduce a framework component with mechanism
Ch.5 [practice] — APPLY: Give reader hands-on exercise
Ch.6 [case_study] — CLOSE: Restate thesis, call to action, final story

═══ INITIALIZE CONTINUITY ═══
Create the initial <<<STATE>>> block (characters, world/facts, timeline, open threads) from this plan, and maintain it across every chapter per the Continuity Protocol in the system prompt.

Confirm you understand the plan and output the initial STATE block, then wait for the first chapter prompt. Do not write any chapter yet.",
